      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ETHANOL VISION (1) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (24.48) at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Tough to beat if on-song. RAE'S RAINBOW (3) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 425m behind Ascend Igloo (24.89) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Should play a prominent role. COBRA (8) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fifth and beaten 4 lengths (22.84) at Warrnambool. A big run wouldn't surprise. HELLO COOPER (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
